lib/API/Docker.pm lists the transport role twice -- as an architecture item ("HTTP Role - L<API::Docker::Role::HTTP> - HTTP transport layer", around line 122) and in SEE ALSO (around line 471). The new L<API::Docker::Role::RegistryAuth>, which carries the X-Registry-Auth / AuthConfig encoding shared by Images, Plugins, Distribution and System, appears in neither, and README.md names no roles at all.

Not fixed with the merge itself: lib/API/Docker.pm was locked to another agent at the time, and README.md is the doc-writer lane.

Add one architecture item and one SEE ALSO entry, and whatever the README module list wants.
